]
#subsection(title: "Fork deadline and idle discovery")[

#points([The admitted absolute deadline covers preparation, membership admission, execution and join acceptance. Approval time precedes arming. Expiration before membership owns no children.], [Before admission and after join callbacks, clock checks can close routing. Expiration withdraws pending members and cancels admitted unsettled members with their same identities.], [A parked scope has no unacknowledged starts and cannot admit or join immediately. Discovery watches every unsettled child revision; lost notifications and independent descendant recovery cannot reopen parent business work.], [After stop commits, dependency-only discovery follows cleanup without an already-expired timestamp causing immediate repeat claims. Streaming partial joins, shared sibling writes, races and quorums are excluded.])
